                "description": "This operation creates a Quote entity. The quote is always created, and the operation is answered with 201 only, whatever the value of instantSyncQuote: the response carries the quote either priced, in state approved, or in state rejected, or in a state that is not final (acknowledged or inProgress), in which case it is priced afterwards. An Expect: 202-Accepted header is ignored.",
